msgctxt "settings.taskProperties.titleCard.occurrenceFilenameTemplateHelp"
msgid "Filename template for materialized occurrences of recurring tasks. Leave empty to keep the existing name (parent title plus a numeric suffix). Choose the filename granularity explicitly with '{{occurrenceDate}}', '{{occurrenceWeek}}', '{{occurrenceMonth}}', '{{occurrenceYear}}', or '{{occurrenceMonthName}}'. All regular filename variables also work. A parent task can override this template via the frontmatter property configured below."
